## Redis

Redis is available as `*redis.Client` from `internal/platform/cache`. Generated CRUD handlers are not cached automatically. Handwritten code that needs caching should define the small `Get`/`Set`/`Delete` interface it actually uses.

```bash
docker compose up -d redis
```

Set `REDIS_URL` (see `.env.example`). Do not commit secrets. The Compose Redis port binds to `127.0.0.1`.
